  "body": "In the metadata for images served up it'd be lovely to say how many colour channels they have (especially if they have alpha) alongside the width & height etc.  This would let us assume that if an image has an alpha channel already, we shouldn't be putting a dropshadow on it in the webclient.\n\n(Imported from https://matrix.org/jira/browse/SYN-170)\n\n(Reported by @ara4n)",
